["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/evidenceUUID", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The UUID used by a reporting management system or any other lifecycle management tool to uniquely identify an evidence relationship item. UUID, or universally unique ID, is a standard term to refer to evidence items.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
